WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.142
Two world wars came within

2
00:00:02.142 --> 00:00:03.124
31 years.

3
00:00:03.124 --> 00:00:05.357
India was drawn into both.

4
00:00:05.683 --> 00:00:07.880
The First World War began

5
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:08.766
in 1914,

6
00:00:08.766 --> 00:00:11.997
after an assassination at Sarajevo.

7
00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:14.282
The Treaty of Versailles came

8
00:00:14.282 --> 00:00:15.075
in 1919.

9
00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:17.392
The Second War began in

10
00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.434
1939.

11
00:00:18.772 --> 00:00:20.604
These were total wars: whole

12
00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:22.249
societies mobilised,

13
00:00:22.249 --> 00:00:24.281
and civilians targeted.

14
00:00:24.627 --> 00:00:26.645
Over a million Indian soldiers

15
00:00:26.645 --> 00:00:28.362
served in the First World

16
00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:30.044
War. The war's costs fed

17
00:00:30.044 --> 00:00:31.803
the national movement.

18
00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:33.669
Your turn.

19
00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:35.439
When was it signed?
